WEBVTT

00:10:28.458 --> 00:10:34.726
and traditional e-commerce platforms
like Amazon will need to adapt

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.417
or risk becoming irrelevant.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.268
For brands,

00:10:39.292 --> 00:10:41.143
this is a crucial next step

00:10:41.167 --> 00:10:43.809
and an unprecedented opportunity,

00:10:43.833 --> 00:10:47.393
moving on from mass marketing
in the 20th century

00:10:47.417 --> 00:10:52.226
and analytics-based hyperpersonalization
in the last two decades,

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:56.976
to building a truly authentic
and deep personal connection

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.809
with their consumers.

00:10:58.833 --> 00:11:00.434
And for us shoppers,